# Caption Font — DO NOT BREAK

The mogrt has **one** param named exactly **`Caption Font`**.

It is published **Source Text**, not a font-menu object.

Value = **plain string** (PostScript / system name), e.g. `Inter-SemiBold`.

```js
if (String(param.displayName) === "Caption Font") {
  param.setValue(fontName, 1);
}
```

- Never `{ systemName }`, never `fontEditValue`, never TextDocument JSON, never arrays.
- Never match `Caption Font>Text>Source Text` / leaf `Source Text`.
- Name is always `Caption Font`. There is not a second font param.
